      "source_quote": "11.1 66% (vol/vol) 二氯甲烷(DCM)/33% 甲醇混合液浸泡。(Temperature: RT, Time: 3 hours)  \n",
      "node_id": "N0041",
      "parent_id": "N0040"
    },
    {
      "label": "11.2",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 2920,
      "end": 2976,
      "label_start": 2920,
      "label_end": 2924,
      "body_start": 2925,
      "body": "100% DCM 浸泡。(Temperature: RT, Time: 2 × 1.5 hours)\n",
      "source_quote": "11.2 100% DCM 浸泡。(Temperature: RT, Time: 2 × 1.5 hours)\n",
      "node_id": "N0042",
      "parent_id": "N0040"
    },
    {
      "label": "12",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 2977,
      "end": 3020,
      "label_start": 2977,
      "label_end": 2979,
      "body_start": 2980,
      "body": "RI 匹配（Refractive index matching, DBE）  \n",
      "source_quote": "12 RI 匹配（Refractive index matching, DBE）  \n",
      "node_id": "N0043",
      "parent_id": null
    },
    {
      "label": "12.1",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 3020,
      "end": 3104,
      "label_start": 3020,
      "label_end": 3024,
      "body_start": 3025,
      "body": "100% 二苄醚（DBE, RI≈1.56）预浸泡。(Temperature: RT, Time: 3 hours, Light: protected)  \n",
      "source_quote": "12.1 100% 二苄醚（DBE, RI≈1.56）预浸泡。(Temperature: RT, Time: 3 hours, Light: protected)  \n",
      "node_id": "N0044",
      "parent_id": "N0043"
    },
    {
      "label": "12.2",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 3104,
      "end": 3194,
      "label_start": 3104,
      "label_end": 3108,
      "body_start": 3109,
      "body": "新鲜 100% DBE 继续浸泡至完全透明（全脑通常需要）。(Temperature: RT, Time: 12–24 hours, Light: protected)\n",
      "source_quote": "12.2 新鲜 100% DBE 继续浸泡至完全透明（全脑通常需要）。(Temperature: RT, Time: 12–24 hours, Light: protected)\n",
      "node_id": "N0045",
      "parent_id": "N0043"
    },
    {
      "label": "13",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 3195,
      "end": 3232,
      "label_start": 3195,
      "label_end": 3197,
      "body_start": 3198,
      "body": "保存与成像前处理（Storage & pre-imaging）  \n",
      "source_quote": "13 保存与成像前处理（Storage & pre-imaging）  \n",
      "node_id": "N0046",
      "parent_id": null
    },
    {
      "label": "13.1",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 3232,
      "end": 3325,
      "label_start": 3232,
      "label_end": 3236,
      "body_start": 3237,
      "body": "样本全程浸没于新鲜 100% DBE，避光密封保存（尽量充满容器减少氧化）。(Temperature: RT or 4 ℃, Time: up to 1–2 weeks)  \n",
      "source_quote": "13.1 样本全程浸没于新鲜 100% DBE，避光密封保存（尽量充满容器减少氧化）。(Temperature: RT or 4 ℃, Time: up to 1–2 weeks)  \n",
      "node_id": "N0047",
      "parent_id": "N0046"
    },
    {
      "label": "13.2",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 3325,
      "end": 3393,
      "label_start": 3325,
      "label_end": 3329,
      "body_start": 3330,
      "body": "光片成像前更换一次新鲜 DBE 并静置脱气泡/沉降。(Temperature: RT, Time: 1–2 hours)  \n",
      "source_quote": "13.2 光片成像前更换一次新鲜 DBE 并静置脱气泡/沉降。(Temperature: RT, Time: 1–2 hours)  \n",
      "node_id": "N0048",
      "parent_id": "N0046"
    },
    {
      "label": "13.3",
      "punctuation": "",
      "start": 3393,
      "end": 3497,
      "label_start": 3393,
      "label_end": 3397,
      "body_start": 3398,
      "body": "成像介质与物镜匹配：使用 RI≈1.56 的DBE兼容成像腔与密封材料；样本固定于支架后直接进行全脑光片扫描。(Temperature: RT, Time: per imaging session)",
      "source_quote": "13.3 成像介质与物镜匹配：使用 RI≈1.56 的DBE兼容成像腔与密封材料；样本固定于支架后直接进行全脑光片扫描。(Temperature: RT, Time: per imaging session)",
      "node_id": "N0049",
      "parent_id": "N0046"
    }
